":189,\"name\":\"Artist\",\"slug\":\"artist\"},{\"id\":221,\"name\":\"Graphic Design\",\"slug\":\"graphic-design\"}],\"styles\":[{\"id\":236,\"name\":\"Light\",\"slug\":\"light\"},{\"id\":111,\"name\":\"Minimal\",\"slug\":\"minimal\"},{\"id\":222,\"name\":\"Grid\",\"slug\":\"grid\"}],\"mainCategory\":{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},\"features\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Appear Effects\",\"slug\":\"appear-effects\"},{\"id\":13,\"name\":\"Slideshows/Tickers\",\"slug\":\"slideshows-tickers\"},{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"Sticky Scrolling\",\"slug\":\"sticky-scrolling\"},{\"id\":18,\"name\":\"Scroll Effects\",\"slug\":\"scroll-effects\"},{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"CMS\",\"slug\":\"cms\"},{\"id\":25,\"name\":\"Custom Cursors\",\"slug\":\"custom-cursors\"},{\"id\":30,\"name\":\"Forms\",\"slug\":\"forms\"},{\"id\":32,\"name\":\"Layout Templates\",\"slug\":\"layout-templates\"},{\"id\":35,\"name\":\"Text Effects\",\"slug\":\"text-effects\"},{\"id\":36,\"name\":\"3D Transforms\",\"slug\":\"3d-transforms\"},{\"id\":37,\"name\":\"Code Components\",\"slug\":\"code-components\"},{\"id\":39,\"name\":\"Selection Styles\",\"slug\":\"selection-styles\"},{\"id\":40,\"name\":\"Variable Fonts\",\"slug\":\"variable-fonts\"}]}},\"index\":1}]\n5f:Ta4e,\u003cp\u003eArcSphere Studio\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"registered\"\u003e®\u003c/span\u003e | Modern Architecture Portfolio\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"link\"\u003e🔗\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://arcsphere-studio.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePreview Here\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eArcSphere Studio is a premium architecture Framer template designed for architects, interior designers, landscape studios, urban planners, and creative firms that want a refined online presence.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeaturing minimalist layouts, immersive project showcases, CMS-powered case studies, premium animations, and a fully responsive experience, it\u0026#39;s built to present your work with clarity, professionalism, and impact—without writing code.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eKey Features\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMinimal architecture-inspired design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eImmersive project showcases\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS-powered portfolio \u0026amp; case studies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePremium animations \u0026amp; micro-interactions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully responsive across all devices\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo-code customization\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOrganized components\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerformance optimized\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003ePerfect For\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eArchitects, architecture studios, interior designers, landscape architects, urban planners, luxury real estate developers, design consultancies, creative agencies, and freelance design professionals.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWhat\u0026#39;s Included\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e25% OFF Framer Yearly Plan Promo Code\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFREE Lifetime Updates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully Responsive Design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS-Powered Projects \u0026amp; Case Studies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePremium Animations \u0026amp; Micro-Interactions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOrganized Components \u0026amp; Easy Customization\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePremium Email Support (including live call/video guidance)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eOptional Customization Available\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eNeed help getting started? A \u003cstrong\u003eCustomization Plan\u003c/strong\u003e is available at checkout, including branding setup (logo, colors, fonts), content replacement, and website publishing using the assets you provide.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePlease note that this service \u003cstrong\u003edoes not include\u003c/strong\u003e redesigning existing sections, adding new sections or pages, custom development, or changing the template\u0026#39;s layout or functionality. Any additional custom work is quoted separately.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eRefund Policy\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eDue to the nature of digital products, \u003cstrong\u003eall purchases are final and non-refundable\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSupport\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003ePremium email support is included with every purchase.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEmail:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"mailto:contact@firstframe.agency\"\u003econtact@firstframe.agency\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e59:[\"$\",\"$L56\",\"66901\",{\"resource\":{\"id\":\"66901\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"ArcSphere Studio\",\"body\":\"$5f\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"ArcSphere Studio\"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"registered\",\"emoji\":\"®\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" | Modern Architecture Portfolio\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"link\",\"emoji\":\"🔗\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Preview Here\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://arcsphere-studio.framer.website/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"ArcSphere Studio is a premi