ate\",\"attributes\":{\"price\":\"59\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_QwArz8pkwHxLId113Pc3m0IW4cnDLRESadxKd0Z2NCJ\",\"remixUrl\":null,\"previewUrl\":\"https://arcsphere-studio.framer.website/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":14,\"name\":\"Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"landing-page\"},{\"id\":187,\"name\":\"Architecture\",\"slug\":\"architecture\"},{\"id\":210,\"name\":\"Digital Products\",\"slug\":\"digital-products\"},{\"id\":230,\"name\":\"Interior Design\",\"slug\":\"interior-design\"}],\"styles\":[],\"mainCategory\":{\"id\":25,\"name\":\"Property\",\"slug\":\"real-estate\"},\"features\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Appear Effects\",\"slug\":\"appear-effects\"},{\"id\":9,\"name\":\"Overlays \u0026 Modals\",\"slug\":\"overlays-modals\"},{\"id\":13,\"name\":\"Slideshows/Tickers\",\"slug\":\"slideshows-tickers\"},{\"id\":18,\"name\":\"Scroll Effects\",\"slug\":\"scroll-effects\"},{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"CMS\",\"slug\":\"cms\"},{\"id\":23,\"name\":\"Rich Media\",\"slug\":\"rich-media\"},{\"id\":25,\"name\":\"Custom Cursors\",\"slug\":\"custom-cursors\"},{\"id\":30,\"name\":\"Forms\",\"slug\":\"forms\"},{\"id\":35,\"name\":\"Text Effects\",\"slug\":\"text-effects\"},{\"id\":40,\"name\":\"Variable Fonts\",\"slug\":\"variable-fonts\"}]}},\"index\":2}]\n60:Tb9a,\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"link\"\u003e🔗\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://meeko-template.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eLive preview →\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"point_right\"\u003e👉\u003c/span\u003e  \u003ca href=\"https://www.framer.com/@elemis-themes/?tab=template\u0026amp;sort=popular\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eBrowse more free templates →\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMeeko is a modern Framer portfolio template built for designers, developers, freelancers, and creative professionals who want a clean and professional portfolio website.\u003c/strong\u003e With flexible layouts, CMS-powered content, and reusable UI components, Meeko makes it easy to launch a polished personal portfolio.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe template includes \u003cstrong\u003e3 home page layouts and 2 portfolio layout options\u003c/strong\u003e, giving you multiple ways to present your projects and customize the structure of your site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMeeko also features modern interactions including \u003cstrong\u003eslideshows, sticky navigation, smooth animations, and scroll-based animations\u003c/strong\u003e, creating a dynamic browsing experience while keeping the design minimal and professional.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you are creating a \u003cstrong\u003edesigner portfolio, developer portfolio, or creative personal website\u003c/strong\u003e, Meeko includes the essential sections and components needed to showcase your work, skills, and experience clearly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eKey Features\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3 Home Page Layouts\u003c/strong\u003e – Three modern home page designs for a strong first impression.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2 Portfolio Layouts\u003c/strong\u003e – Two flexible layouts to showcase your work.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePortfolio CMS\u003c/strong\u003e – Easily manage and display portfolio projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBlog CMS\u003c/strong\u003e – Publish articles and improve SEO with the built-in blog.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSlideshow Sections\u003c/strong\u003e – Showcase featured projects and content\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTabs Component\u003c/strong\u003e – Organize services, skills, or testimonials.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTestimonial Sections\u003c/strong\u003e – Display client feedback with tabs or sliders.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSkills with Progress Bars\u003c/strong\u003e – Present your expertise visually.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnimated Counters\u003c/strong\u003e – Highlight key numbers and achievements.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExperience Timeline\u003c/strong\u003e – Showcase your career and milestones.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFAQ Section\u003c/strong\u003e – Organize common questions with an accordion.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProcess Section\u003c/strong\u003e – Explain your workflow step by step.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContact Form\u003c/strong\u003e – Make it easy for clients to get in touch.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eModern Interactions\u003c/strong\u003e – Smooth animations, sticky navigation, slideshows, scroll effects, and interactive testimonials.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFully Responsive\u003c/strong\u003e – Optimized for desktop, tablet, and mobile.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e5a:[\"$\",\"$L56\",\"61205\",{\"resource\":{\"id\":\"61205\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Meeko\",\"body\":\"$60\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"link\",\"emoji\":\"🔗\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"  \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Live preview →\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://meeko-template.framer.website/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"point_right\",\"emoji\":\"👉\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"  \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Browse more free templates →\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://www.framer.com/@elemis-themes/?tab=template\u0026sort=popular\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Meeko is a modern Framer portfolio template built for designers, developers, freelancers, and creative professionals who want a clean and professional portfolio website.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" With flexible layouts, CMS-powered content, and reusable UI components, Meeko makes it easy to launch a polished personal portfolio.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The template includes \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"3 home page layouts and 2 portfolio layout options\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", giving you multiple ways to present your projects and customize the structure of your site.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Meeko also features modern interactions including \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"slideshows, sticky navigation, smooth animations, and scroll-based animations\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", creating a dynamic browsing experience while keeping the design minimal and professional.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Whether you are creating a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"designer portfolio, developer portfolio, or creative personal website\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", Meeko includes the essential sections and components needed to showcase your work, skills, and experience clearly.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Key Features\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"3 Home Page Layouts\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – Three modern home page designs for a strong first impression.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"2 Portfolio Layouts\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – Two flexible layouts to showcase your work.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Portfolio CMS\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – Easily manage and display portfolio projects.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Blog CMS\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – Publish articles and improve SEO with the built-in blog.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Slideshow Sections\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – Showcase featured projects and content\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Tabs Component\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – Organize services, skills, or testimonials.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Testimonial Sections\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – Display client feedback with tabs or sliders.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Skills with Progress Bars\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – Present your expertise visually.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Animated Counters\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – Highlight key numbers and achievements.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Experience Timeline\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – Showcase your career and milestones.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"FAQ Section\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – Organize common questions with an accordion.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Process Section\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – Explain your workflow step by step.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Contact Form\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – Make it easy for clients to get in touch.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Modern Interactions\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – Smooth animations, sticky navigation, slideshows, scroll effects, and interactive testimonials.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Fully Responsive\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" – Optimized for desktop, tablet, and mobile.\"}]}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Creative Portfolio Template\",\"slug\":\"meeko\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"db7a6821-a4ec-45fb-88fc-f791fbb3c977\",\"name\":\"Elemis