"Animated\",\"slug\":\"animated\"},{\"id\":243,\"name\":\"Pastel\",\"slug\":\"pastel\"},{\"id\":201,\"name\":\"Colorful\",\"slug\":\"colorful\"}],\"mainCategory\":{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},\"features\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Appear Effects\",\"slug\":\"appear-effects\"},{\"id\":13,\"name\":\"Slideshows/Tickers\",\"slug\":\"slideshows-tickers\"},{\"id\":17,\"name\":\"Sticky Scrolling\",\"slug\":\"sticky-scrolling\"},{\"id\":18,\"name\":\"Scroll Effects\",\"slug\":\"scroll-effects\"},{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"CMS\",\"slug\":\"cms\"},{\"id\":23,\"name\":\"Rich Media\",\"slug\":\"rich-media\"},{\"id\":25,\"name\":\"Custom Cursors\",\"slug\":\"custom-cursors\"},{\"id\":30,\"name\":\"Forms\",\"slug\":\"forms\"},{\"id\":32,\"name\":\"Layout Templates\",\"slug\":\"layout-templates\"},{\"id\":35,\"name\":\"Text Effects\",\"slug\":\"text-effects\"},{\"id\":36,\"name\":\"3D Transforms\",\"slug\":\"3d-transforms\"},{\"id\":37,\"name\":\"Code Components\",\"slug\":\"code-components\"},{\"id\":40,\"name\":\"Variable Fonts\",\"slug\":\"variable-fonts\"},{\"id\":41,\"name\":\"Vector Sets\",\"slug\":\"vector-sets\"}]}},\"index\":3}]\n61:T54d,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTransform your creative portfolio into a stunning macOS experience.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis isn't just another portfolio template, it's a meticulously crafted digital workspace that brings the elegance and simplicity of Apple's design language to your personal brand. Perfect for creative directors, brand designers, photographers, and visual artists who want to stand out with a portfolio that feels as premium as their work.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat makes MakOS different:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ \u003cstrong\u003eInteractive resume experience\u003c/strong\u003e - Your CV isn't buried in a PDF. It lives in a beautifully designed, scannable interface that reads like Apple Notes meets LinkedIn\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ \u003cstrong\u003eModular project showcase\u003c/strong\u003e — Flexible gallery layouts to present case studies, photography, branding work, or any creative output. Each project tells its story\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ \u003cstrong\u003ePerformance-obsessed\u003c/strong\u003e — Lightweight, fast-loading, and optimized. Built following Apple's own performance principles\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreative Directors • Brand Designers • Art Directors • Visual Designers • UI/UX Designers • Graphic Designers • Photographers • Illustrators • Motion Designers • Creative Consultants • Freelance Creatives • Agency Founders • Design Leaders • Portfolio Sites • Personal Branding\u003c/p\u003e5b:[\"$\",\"$L56\",\"60415\",{\"resource\":{\"id\":\"60415\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"MakOS\",\"body\":\"$61\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Creative Portfolio Template\",\"slug\":\"makos\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"e6c9a8a0-7715-42a8-899d-11cd4ea65607\",\"name\":\"Immerse Studio\",\"slug\":\"immerse-studio\",\"avatar\":null,\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/60415/makos-yxHkLR4rTEmuGVwtLxP5E2IfTjFJaO\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/60415/makos-dZAHo1B08CuqMsFRI6m5lNziA6iSSf\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/templates/60415/makos-Wu2pqrdRcBlH8Qw6LIOQGWKLHskJEv\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019c9fc8-3982-7dd0-b9fd-f0c87e85c6e5\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":2051,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":24},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"rep